piece football
bpm 160
bars 12

# Barnluren, "Should we meet up for football?" — 18.2 s of motion comic.
#
# The film is at 160 BPM already: the three yeses are 45 frames apart, 45
# frames is 1.5 s, and 1.5 s is one bar. They land on bars 6, 7 and 8 to the
# frame, and the pan onto the pitch lands on bar 9. The music starts half a
# second into the picture, which is the pickup the edit has and which lets the
# opening question sit for a moment before anything comments on it.
#
# The story is not sad then happy. It is a question nobody wants asked, a boy
# risking a no, three answers, and then release. So the music is a suspension
# that will not resolve: G over D, held through the cards and through the
# asking, walked up by the three yeses over I - IV - V, and let down onto the
# third of the chord at the moment the frame opens onto grass.
#
#   bar  1-2   the hook card. One note, unresolved, nothing under it
#   bar  3     the turn. The pad arrives; the note softens to the third
#   bar  4-5   the dare. A heartbeat, a rising figure, and then he waits
#   bar  6     yes, Mateo        bell A3 over D   — the fifth
#   bar  7     me too, Hana      bell B3 over G   — the third
#   bar  8     in goal, Yusuf    bell D4 over A   — still suspended
#   bar  9     the match         bell Gb4 over D  — resolved, everything in
#   bar 10     the match, running
#   bar 11-12  the end card, and the same suspension let down one last time

# Gains are 0.9x what they were: the first mix peaked at -0.60 dBFS and
# social delivery wants a ceiling nearer -1.5.
lane bell     clip=football inst=glass   root=D3 gain=0.612 len=20 send=0.6 vel=7
lane bell_low clip=football inst=glass   root=D3 gain=0.360 len=28 send=0.7 vel=6
lane pad      clip=football inst=strings root=D2 gain=0.855 len=26 send=0.45 orbit=2/24/0/0/0/1 vel=7
lane pad_high clip=football inst=strings root=D2 gain=0.666 len=26 send=0.5 orbit=2/24/0.5/0/0/1 vel=6
lane ground   clip=football inst=bass    root=D1 gain=0.558 len=6 duck vel=7
lane heart    clip=football inst=kick    root=D1 gain=0.468 len=0.45s

